<title>USA: USDA delays world cotton price to Friday.</title>
<headline>USDA delays world cotton price to Friday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weekly world cotton price report, usually released on Thursdays, will be released on Friday because of the Thanksgiving holiday, the Agriculture Department said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The report will be released Friday at 0800 EST/1300 GMT.</p>
